sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sensor as Sensor<br/>(SessionManager)
    participant LoRa as LoRa (host-owned)
    participant Gateway as Gateway<br/>(SessionManager)
    participant SE_S as SecureElement (sensor)
    participant SE_G as SecureElement (gateway)
    participant RNG_S as RandomSource (sensor)
    participant RNG_G as RandomSource (gateway)

    Note over Sensor,Gateway: Fast resume — Request MAC'd with durable resume_psk (from install).<br/>Challenge clear-text + chal_mac. Confirm AEAD under new key. Static↔static ECDH via SE.

    Note over Sensor: start_resume(peer, &mut se, &mut rng, now)<br/>rejects active key; requires resume_psk from NVRAM / Session

    Sensor->>RNG_S: fill_bytes(sensor_nonce[16])
    Sensor->>Sensor: req_mac = HKDF(resume_psk, "sigil-resume-req" ‖ sensor_mac ‖ nonce)
    Sensor->>LoRa: Transmit ResumeRequest<br/>{peer_mac[17], frame_type=0x21, sensor_nonce[16], req_mac[16]}

    Note over Gateway: handle_resume_request(packet, &mut se, &mut rng, now, key_lifetime_secs)

    LoRa->>Gateway: ResumeRequest
    Gateway->>Gateway: verify req_mac with resume_psk (before SE-ECDH)
    alt invalid MAC
        Gateway-->>Gateway: VerificationFailed (no SE-ECDH)
    else valid MAC
        Gateway->>SE_G: ecdh(peer_static_pub) → shared_secret
        Gateway->>RNG_G: fill_bytes(gateway_nonce[16])
        Gateway->>Gateway: derive_session_key(shared, "sigil-resume" ‖ nonces ‖ key_lifetime_secs)
        Gateway->>Gateway: stash new_key in PendingHandshake
        Gateway->>LoRa: Transmit ResumeChallenge (clear)<br/>{peer_mac[17], frame_type=0x22, gateway_nonce[16], key_lifetime_secs[4], chal_mac[16]}
    end

    Note over Sensor: continue_resume(challenge, &mut se, now)

    LoRa->>Sensor: ResumeChallenge (clear)
    Sensor->>SE_S: ecdh(peer_static_pub) → same shared_secret
    Sensor->>Sensor: verify chal_mac; derive_session_key(...)
    Sensor->>Sensor: update_key(new_key, new_prefix, expire) — counters reset to 0
    Sensor->>LoRa: Transmit ResumeConfirm (AEAD under new_key, ctr=0)<br/>{peer_mac[17], frame_type=0x23, prefix[4], counter[8], ct+tag}

    Note over Gateway: continue_resume(confirm, &mut se, now)

    LoRa->>Gateway: ResumeConfirm (encrypted)
    Gateway->>Gateway: AEAD decrypt under stashed new_key (proof of possession)
    Gateway->>Gateway: update_key(stashed new_key, new_prefix, expire)
    Gateway-->>Gateway: Success { peer }

    Note over Sensor,Gateway: Both peers share the resumed session key.<br/>Host reloads peer static pubkey + resume_psk from NVRAM before resume.
